    "title": "Looking for Medical Officer at Jaypee Hospital Consulting Pvt Ltd",
    "description": "Jaypee Hospital Consulting Pvt Ltd has an exciting opening for a Medical Officer at our Hyderabad office. Join a company that values innovation, collaboration, and continuous learning.\n\nAbout Jaypee Hospital Consulting Pvt Ltd:\nJaypee Hospital Consulting Pvt Ltd is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Provide high-quality patient care and maintain patient records\n• Maintain sterile environments and follow infection control protocols\n• Diagnose and treat medical conditions following established protocols\n• Coordinate with multidisciplinary teams for comprehensive patient management\n• Educate patients and families on health management and disease prevention\n• Adhere to NABH/JCI accreditation standards\n• Monitor patient progress and adjust treatment plans accordingly\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Ed / M.Ed from a recognized institution\n• 6-10 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Surgical Procedures\n• Proficiency in Infection Control\n• Proficiency in Medical Terminology\n• Proficiency in HIPAA Compliance\n• Proficiency in Patient Care\n• Proficiency in Telemedicine\n• Proficiency in BLS/ACLS\n• Proficiency in Clinical Documentation\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Flexible working hours\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Annual performance appraisal\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Salary Range: 12 LPA - 25 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Hyderabad, Telangana, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Jaypee Hospital Consulting Pvt Ltd!",
